  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1a2b3c4d5e6f708192a3b4c5d6e7f801, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tuning_Loose
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  profileName: Loose
  whyThisSetup: 'REJECTED as the default. Grip 8 against exactly the same steering
    curve as Balanced, so full lock always asks for more grip than the car has and
    the back end steps out in every corner. Genuinely the most fun of the three and
    the handbrake finally means something. Rejected because the slide is large enough
    that stopping on a marked delivery point becomes luck rather than skill, and because
    the 17.4 m stopping distance forces the camera further back than reads well. Keep
    as a strong candidate for a heavy load or wet weather modifier, where the player
    has been told the car is worse and can plan for it.'
